[{"answer":"Good morning. Stretton Festival box office. How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My family and I are on holiday in the area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've seen some posters about the festival this week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me about some of the events, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, are there still tickets available for the jazz band on Saturday?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There are, but only £15.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The £12 seats have all been sold.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And the venue is the school, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right, the secondary school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure you don't go to the primary school by mistake!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's an additional performer who isn't mentioned on the posters -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Carolyn Hart is going to play with the band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I think I've heard her on the radio.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Doesn't she play the oboe, or flute or something?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes the flute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/17.mp3"},{"answer":"She usually plays with symphony orchestras,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and apparently this is her first time with a jazz band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd certainly like to hear her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the next thing I want to ask about is the duck races -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw a poster beside a river. What are they, exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you buy a yellow plastic duck - or as many as you like - they're a pound each.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And you write your name on each one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be several races, depending on the number of ducks taking part.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And John Stevens, a champion swimmer who lives locally, is going to start the races.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"All the ducks will be launched into the river at the back of the cinema,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"then they'll float along the river for 500 metres, as far as the railway bridge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And are there any prizes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the first duck in each race to arrive at the finishing line wins its owner free tickets for the concert on the last night of the festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You said you can buy a duck?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure my children will both want one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/32.mp3"},{"answer":"They're on sale at a stall in the market.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/33.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't miss it -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/34.mp3"},{"answer":"it's got an enormous sign showing a couple of ducks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/35.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'll go there this afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember walking past there yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Now could you tell me something about the flower show, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, admission is free,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and the show is being held in Bythwaite Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, how do you spell that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/41.mp3"},{"answer":"B-Y-T-H-W-A-I-T-E.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Bythwaite.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it easy to find?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not very familiar with the town yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, you won't have any problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's right in the centre of Stretton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the only old building in the town, so it's easy to recognise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume it's open all day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but if you'd like to see the prizes being awarded for the best flowers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/51.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll need to be there at 5 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/52.mp3"},{"answer":"The prizes are being given by a famous actor, Kevin Shapless.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/53.mp3"},{"answer":"He lives nearby and gets involved in a lot of community events.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Gosh, I've seen him on TV.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll definitely go to the prize-giving.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I've seen a list of plays that are being performed this week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to know which are suitable for my children,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and which ones my husband and I might go to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/60.mp3"},{"answer":"How old are your children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Five and seven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/62.mp3"},{"answer":"What about 'The Mystery of Muldoon'?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That's aimed at five to ten-year-olds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So if I take my children, I can expect them to enjoy it more than I do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I think so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/66.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like something for yourself and your husband and leave your children with a babysitter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/67.mp3"},{"answer":"you might like to see 'Fire and Flood' -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/68.mp3"},{"answer":"it's about events that really happened in Stretton 200 years ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and children might find it rather frightening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, thanks for the warning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, what about 'Silly Sailor'?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/72.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a comedy, and it's for young and old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/73.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, it won an award in the Stretton Drama Festival a couple of months ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/74.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, goodbye, and thanks for all the information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm looking forward to the festival!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-4-part-1-2023-06-08-13-11-21/78.mp3"}]
